Subject: Move the operator from bcprov/bcpkix-jdk15on 1.70 to jdk18on 1.86
Origin: DHI-internal (backport of the Bouncy Castle hunks of an upstream 1.19 commit)
CVE: CVE-2023-33201
CVE: CVE-2024-29857
CVE: CVE-2024-30171
CVE: CVE-2024-30172
CVE: CVE-2024-34447
CVE: CVE-2025-8916
CVE: CVE-2026-5588
Description: Build the 1.18 operator against the maintained Bouncy Castle jdk18on artifacts.
 The jdk15on artifacts stopped at 1.70 and receive no fixes. Upstream moved the
 operator to bcprov-jdk18on and bcpkix-jdk18on on the 1.19 line in
 https://github.com/ongres/stackgres/commit/66cd4f2a51b12022ca97d05d100227b388d5cdf9;
 the classes and packages are the same, so only the Maven coordinates change.
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/ongres/stackgres.git de07225fa07fb0e583168acfe3b41f92f0277f80
Adaptation: Takes only the Bouncy Castle hunks of that commit (the Quarkus bump is patch/quarkus-3.33-container.patch, and the sundrio 0.300.0 bump stays out), sets bouncycastle.version to 1.86 as the 1.19.5 release does instead of the commit's 1.84, and manages bcutil-jdk18on at the same version so the Quarkus BOM's 1.83 does not ship next to bcprov 1.86.
Regenerate: `git -C <stackgres checkout at 1.18.10> show 66cd4f2a51b12022ca97d05d100227b388d5cdf9 -- stackgres-k8s/src/pom.xml stackgres-k8s/src/operator/pom.xml`, keep only the Bouncy Castle hunks, set bouncycastle.version to 1.86 and add a bcutil-jdk18on dependencyManagement entry at ${bouncycastle.version}.
Forwarded: not-needed (upstream made this move on the 1.19 line; 1.18.10 still ships jdk15on 1.70)
Drop-When: upstream >= 1.19.0 (only the 1.18 leaves apply it)
Verify: sbom pkg:maven/org.bouncycastle/bcprov-jdk18on@1.86

